      "role": "user",
      "content": "Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters\n\nGiven a string s, find the length of the longest substring without duplicate characters.\n\nExample: s = 'abcabcbb' -> 3 ('abc'). s = 'bbbbb' -> 1.\nConstraints: 0 <= len(s) <= 5 * 10^4; s consists of English letters, digits, symbols and spaces.",
      "id": "m-0",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-11T10:14:01.437Z",
      "durationMs": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "channel": "analysis",
      "content": "Complexity check: one pass, O(n) time, O(n) auxiliary space for the map. That meets the constraint.\n\nEdge cases to cover before submitting: empty input, single element, and the all-duplicates case.\n\nKey invariant: the data structure state after processing prefix i fully determines the answer for i+1.",
      "id": "m-1",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-11T10:14:01.691Z",
      "durationMs": 14101,
      "stepIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
